{"id":"cae6dd8861747be5","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-solovay-distributive-refinement.md","title":"Distributive Refinement of a Solovay Bound","display":"thm-solovay-distributive-refinement — Distributive Refinement of a Solovay Bound","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-solovay-distributive-refinement","aliases":["43-thm-solovay-distributive-refinement"],"display":"thm-solovay-distributive-refinement — Distributive Refinement of a Solovay Bound","depends_on":["[[43-df-solovay-red]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Theorem 13.4.1, distributivity proof","source_printed_pages":"346","source_pdf_pages":"366","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-solovay-distributive-refinement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-solovay-distributive-refinement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay-distributive-refinement — Distributive Refinement of a Solovay Bound"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 13.4.1, distributivity proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"346"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"366"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_0,\\alpha_1,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha_0,\\alpha_1,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>。见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_0,\\beta_1\">\\(\\beta_0,\\beta_1\\)</span> 量化于实数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\le_S\\alpha_0+\\alpha_1\\implies\\exists\\beta_0,\\beta_1\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta_0)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta_1)\\land\\beta=\\beta_0+\\beta_1\\land\\beta_0\\le_S\\alpha_0\\land\\beta_1\\le_S\\alpha_1\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta\\le_S\\alpha_0+\\alpha_1\\implies\\exists\\beta_0,\\beta_1\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta_0)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta_1)\\land\\beta=\\beta_0+\\beta_1\\land\\beta_0\\le_S\\alpha_0\\land\\beta_1\\le_S\\alpha_1\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是上半格分配性的见证式表达。原书把对和的有界有效分配系数分别作用于两个加数的增量，得到两个归约见证；本节保留精确实数相等式，而不是只断言两度相等。此处核对原书证明中该具体陈述，未把本轮记录升级为完整原书证明审计。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 13.4.1, distributivity proof；印刷页 346，PDF 页 366。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha_0,\\alpha_1,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$ 均满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$；$\\le_S$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-red]]。见证 $\\beta_0,\\beta_1$ 量化于实数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha_0,\\alpha_1,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_0,\\beta_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\le_S\\alpha_0+\\alpha_1\\implies\\exists\\beta_0,\\beta_1\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta_0)\\land\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta_1)\\land\\beta=\\beta_0+\\beta_1\\land\\beta_0\\le_S\\alpha_0\\land\\beta_1\\le_S\\alpha_1\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1699,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-solovay-distributive-refinement]] — Distributive Refinement of a Solovay Bound"}],"outgoing":["a566c9610179ba40"]}